    {
      "id": "dusk_kest_rod_gave",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "Kest takes it down off two pegs. “Sixteen and a half foot, and worn smooth at both ends,” Kest says. “I have had it eleven years. Somebody wore those ends and it was not me and it was not in eleven years.”"
        }
      ],
